---
config:
  theme: dark
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: '#ffcc00'
    primaryTextColor: '#003366'
    lineColor: '#008800'
    secondaryColor: '#99ccff'
    tertiaryColor: '#ffe6f0'
    background: '#fff2cc'
description: >-
  baseline/themes/default.mmd, the representative requirement diagram, under base-colour overrides in the dark theme
  (#1035, D656): the relation lines and markers keep v12 dark's #d3d3d3 under the lineColor override
  (canvasLineColor), as in v12
---
requirementDiagram

  requirement test_req {
    id: 1
    text: the test text.
    risk: high
    verifymethod: test
  }

  functionalRequirement test_req2 {
    id: 1.1
    text: the second test text.
    risk: low
    verifymethod: inspection
  }

  performanceRequirement test_req3 {
    id: 1.2
    text: the third test text.
    risk: medium
    verifymethod: demonstration
  }

  element test_entity {
    type: simulation
  }

  element test_entity2 {
    type: word doc
    docRef: reqs/test_entity
  }

  test_entity - satisfies -> test_req2
  test_req - traces -> test_req2
  test_req - contains -> test_req3
  test_entity2 - verifies -> test_req
